cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "MetaSTREAM: a Snakemake pipeline for resistome, mobilome and taxonomic profiling from Oxford Nanopore metagenomic sequencing"
version: 1.0.0
license: "MIT"
type: software
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
abstract: "MetaSTREAM is a reproducible Snakemake pipeline integrating quality control, taxonomic profiling, resistome (RGI/CARD) and mobilome (mobileOG-db) analysis, and contig-level ARG x MGE co-localization from Oxford Nanopore shotgun metagenomic sequencing data. Developed for wastewater-based antimicrobial resistance surveillance in Conakry, Guinea."
